(3516168, 491369, 72317, '<td valign="top">This is very good. Great idea and all. Includes every object. /Fantastic/ idea for vanishing. But since this placed first, I''m a bit disappointed at the odd use of the wine glass, the ice, and the lollipop. It seems like everyone did the same exact thing. They stuck objects into the wine glass and placed them in places. Something actually vanished in this picture which was definitely good. But since it placed first, I''m a tad bit disappointed that the objects weren''t used in the vanishing process. Still, I guess I can''t say much. As Pawdrix said, this is the fourth highest rated image ever. Congratulations. You deserve it. :)</td>', 'This is very good. Great idea and all. Includes every object. /Fantastic/ idea for vanishing. But since this placed first, I''m a bit disappointed at the odd use of the wine glass, the ice, and the lollipop. It seems like everyone did the same exact thing. They stuck objects into the wine glass and placed them in places. Something actually vanished in this picture which was definitely good. But since it placed first, I''m a tad bit disappointed that the objects weren''t used in the vanishing process. Still, I guess I can''t say much. As Pawdrix said, this is the fourth highest rated image ever. Congratulations. You deserve it. :)', '2007-04-03 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
